WARNING:DEVICE_ATTR_FUNCTIONS: Consider renaming function(s) 'splash_show_enabled' to 'enabled_show' 'splash_store_enabled' to 'enabled_store'
#134: FILE: drivers/video/fbdev/core/bootsplash.c:261:
